reviews.text:
I asked the staff for two recommended cocktails (7,000 won on the menu), but they paid for 400,000 won worth of champagne without my consent and did not issue a refund.
I just resigned myself to drinking it, but while I was going to the bathroom, the champagne I put on the bar table disappeared. No action taken on this either haha

Even if business doesn't work, this is not the way to make money haha;;
